sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant AuthorResource
    participant AuthorService
    participant Author
    participant JPA
    participant PostgreSQL
    participant ResourceExceptionHandler

    Client->>AuthorResource: POST authors with Author body
    activate AuthorResource
    
    AuthorResource->>Author: new Author()
    activate Author
    deactivate Author
    
    Note over AuthorResource,Author: Client instantiates Author via constructor
    
    AuthorResource->>Author: setId(id), setName(name), setEmail(email)
    activate Author
    deactivate Author
    
    Note over AuthorResource,Author: Set id, name, email properties
    
    AuthorResource->>AuthorService: insert(author)
    activate AuthorService
    
    AuthorService->>JPA: persist(author)
    activate JPA
    
    Note over AuthorService,JPA: JPA persists entity to PostgreSQL
    
    JPA->>PostgreSQL: INSERT INTO author (name, email) VALUES (?, ?)
    activate PostgreSQL
    
    Note over JPA,PostgreSQL: Database generates identity value
    
    PostgreSQL-->>JPA: return generated ID
    deactivate PostgreSQL
    
    Note over JPA: Autogenerated primary key (Long)
    
    JPA->>Author: setId(generatedId)
    activate Author
    deactivate Author
    
    Note over JPA,Author: Entity becomes managed by persistence context
    
    deactivate JPA
    
    AuthorService-->>AuthorResource: return author
    deactivate AuthorService
    
    Note over AuthorService,AuthorResource: Managed Author entity with generated ID
    
    AuthorResource-->>Client: ResponseEntity.created(uri).body(author)
    deactivate AuthorResource
    
    Note over AuthorResource,Client: HTTP 201 Created with Location header

    alt Author with duplicate email
        JPA->>PostgreSQL: INSERT fails due to unique constraint
        activate PostgreSQL
        PostgreSQL-->>JPA: throw ConstraintViolationException
        deactivate PostgreSQL
        
        JPA-->>AuthorService: propagate exception
        activate AuthorService
        deactivate AuthorService
        
        AuthorService->>ResourceExceptionHandler: exception caught by ControllerAdvice
        activate ResourceExceptionHandler
        
        ResourceExceptionHandler-->>Client: ResponseEntity with 400 Bad Request
        deactivate ResourceExceptionHandler
    end